{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The undead never stop coming\u2026 but neither do you!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ZK1L4 is a <strong>Left 4 Dead\u2013style roguelike survival shooter</strong> where every run tells a different story. Fight through five handcrafted apocalypse scenarios, unlock devastating skills, and push forward toward a final escape\u2026 or die trying.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast, brutal, and endlessly replayable: ZK1L4 blends <strong>cinematic zombie survival</strong> with <strong>roguelike progression and chaos</strong>. Think <i>Left 4 Dead meets a bullet-heaven roguelite.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>8 Survivors</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from <strong>8 unique survivors</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>60+ Skills</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stack <strong>60+ active and passive skills</strong> to create broken, beautiful chaos:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Critical hit builds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lifesteal monsters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Summoners</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explosive on-hit effects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run-defining synergies</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your choices matter. Your build defines how you survive.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>2 Players Couch Co-op Chaos</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bring a friend, you\u2019ll need them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight side by side in <strong>local 2-player co-op</strong>, combining builds, saving each other from the swarm, and turning desperate runs into heroic escapes.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>5 Unique Scenarios</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each map is a chapter in the apocalypse:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique layouts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A clear narrative goal</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019re not just surviving! you\u2019re <strong>moving through a collapsing world</strong> toward the truth behind the outbreak.<strong> </strong> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>30 Collectibles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover <strong>30 lore collectibles</strong> scattered across the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each one reveals what happened before and during the zombie apocalypse: survivors, experiments, betrayals, and the price of failure.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Enemies</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The swarm is endless\u2026 but not all zombies are equal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face terrifying enemy types:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sneaky</strong> \u2013 Silent, deadly</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fatty</strong> \u2013 Slow, but explosive</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast</strong> \u2013 Relentless hunters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tanky</strong> \u2013 Brutal damage sponges</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Goliath</strong> \u2013 A walking apocalypse</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And now\u2026 a new threat:</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Golden Sir</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A rare elite enemy that drops <strong>powerful rewards</strong> if you can take it down.<br>High risk. High reward. Total chaos.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635000/extras/80e90f2af243c13f42c18bb175e03abd.avif?t=1774125382\" width=720 height=358 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"SUPERIOR PLAYS","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3635000/7a3174989c09ea7ea44d3ba82404dc73a571d0c8.jpg"},{"name":"GODLY SKILLS","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3635000/b925c86b99f103e9914287800b4ecef8bbff3d18.jpg"},{"name":"BIG GAME HUNTER","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3635000/1c891197b30c9abc21389211f191d95befa22f3f.jpg"},{"name":"PERFECTION","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3635000/a4300a01cd994f069112bebdadc01b7f1143cda0.jpg"},{"name":"Z WARRIOR","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3635000/619aca1c58bdd9f65b8bb63b2d17cc789c0188f4.jpg"},{"name":"SHIFU","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3635000/5177a71246bb7a47ba52d7f9854bc82cca9f0d38.jpg"},{"name":"A LITTLE BIT OF EVERYTHING","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3635000/884f664387cbc73a5a7338114e98cb6c5cce66a3.jpg"},{"name":"FULL CAST","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3635000/965e009d406ee421cf9cb10c75e27923215cb2bd.jpg"},{"name":"CHAMELEON","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3635000/77eff203d45009de88827dcbca2f8e6869ef4f20.jpg"},{"name":"GUN EXPERT","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3635000/54766b8e28985397423da18ab9da0ab8ae4bca62.jpg"}],"total":21},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3635000?t=1774125382","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635000/9befa92a813e8420366433d0cb28062ab7338866/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1774125382","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635000/d0827277c467ed3216c17d47aa110e32f1784ad2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774125382","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635000/d0827277c467ed3216c17d47aa110e32f1784ad2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774125382","categories":[{"description":"Single-playe